<title>USA: Softnet unit to develop Malawi network.</title>
<headline>Softnet unit to develop Malawi network.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE FOREST, Ill. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoftNet Systems Inc said Monday its MediaCity World Inc unit has been chosen by the Republic of Malawi to develop and implement the country's nationwide Internet network.</p>
<p>MediaCity was chosen by the African republic in partnership with U.S. Trade Corp, an international development organization.</p>
<p>Shares of systems company Softnet closed down 1/16 at 6-5/16 Monday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
